{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6835bad3-397a-83ec-b195-6c53a197b276",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:42:04-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Peter Burdick",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:40:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:40:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Good morning. My name is Peter Burdick. Can you hear me okay? The phone is on the other side of the table."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:40:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're a little far away, Mr. Burdick, but I can hear you. You can pull it closer if you like."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:40:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, okay. [pause] Is better now? I am calling about the trash. The pickup, it did not come at my house. This is the second time in a row, the second miss."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:40:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry about that. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:40:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "431 Admiral Kalbfus Road. In the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:40:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "431 Admiral Kalbfus Road, got it. Did the barrel go out by the curb on your regular day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:40:51-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I put it out in the morning. Last week, nothing. This week before, nothing also. Maybe the storm, the one from Friday into Saturday, three days ago, but the first miss was before the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:41:02-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll put in a missed pickup report for that address so the crew gets it. Crews have been behind since the storm, so it may take a day or two to come around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:41:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A day or two. Okay. Thank you. I have one more question. The Christmas tree. When do they pick up the Christmas tree?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:41:20-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The tree pickup usually happens in January, after the holiday. The exact dates get announced closer to the time, on the city website and in the paper. For now, just hold onto it until then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:41:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "January. After the holiday. I should wait for the dates?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:41:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Wait for the dates, and when it's time, put the tree out at the curb, with no bags or decorations on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:41:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No bags, no decorations. Okay. I understand. And for the trash, you will report it, the missed one, at 431 Admiral Kalbfus."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:41:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'm entering it now. If it still hasn't been picked up in two days, call us back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:41:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I will call back. Thank you very much, Miss Denise. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:42:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Burdick. Bye now."
    }
  ],
